mapping "V6700.1" source="V6700" target="217897003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6700 = Swedish expansion of parent V670 (driver of heavy truck injured in collision with
        fixed/stationary object, non-traffic accident) with activity=sport/exercise. Parent V670 maps
        athena-verified to SNOMED CT 436292 (Accidental collision with stationary object), 437738 (Motor
        vehicle accident off public road), 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic accident).
        Activity-context suffix has no SNOMED CT representation; targets fully subsume the accident/injury
        meaning. broader, high tier: one-level breadth via inherited athena crosswalk.
        """
}
