mapping "V6724.1" source="V6724" target="214640008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6724 is the Swedish 7-char extension of ICD-10 V67.2 (45575788, SNOMED CT 214640008) with
        the 5th digit encoding the activity context (vital activities such as rest, sleep, meals,
        personal hygiene). The Swedish national extension adds KVÅ-style activity metadata to the base
        ICD-10 transport-injury code. Target SNOMED CT 437738 = (214640008), the most specific SNOMED CT
        target from the V67.2 Athena crosswalk (also 436292, 444074). The off-public-road target
        captures both the nontraffic and motor-vehicle aspects of the source. mapping_type=broader
        because the SNOMED CT target fully captures the clinical injury/accident concept; the lost
        5th-digit activity is contextual encounter metadata, not a clinical aspect of the disorder.
        Confidence (moderate): verified Athena crosswalk on the base code, but the Swedish extension is
        not independently re-verified and the activity-context dimension is dropped.
        """
}
